obs Restored the session roster scan, control, witness, documentation and original recovery log from stash f18ae8b606d7e8e8a85b049fa9071aa6b8d695bc.
obs The scan derives each shelf count and compares both roster files. Its control proves 31 cases, including refusal above 512 shelves and recovery below that bound.
obs The source stash and all 27 others remain. The stash reader counts 27 round-open stashes; the differently named clockin stash explains the difference from git stash list.
obs The stash reader found one unlanded log, six orphan work files and 27 orphan account shelves. This recovery carries the log and three roster-guard files together.
obs The older rye_compiled_reach trio stays parked. The living rye_compile_reach family is rostered and its cold witness passed; a name and header comparison does not prove every parked behavior superseded.
obs The first two detached starts ended without a verdict when their launching shells closed. Keeping the third launching shell open let its pass finish; the printed transcript names this tree and 28 stashed entries matching the live list.
obs Cold ran without tracked file edits: 206 guards, 200 green, four red, two gated. The three root failures were executable modes, seed links and the parked log; standing_equipment summarized them.
obs Ripgrep is installed outside the shell's default PATH. Adding its existing Nix-store bin directory let shell_dialect and amphora_bounds_agree pass.
obs A fresh fetch found Diffuser's 9230cb0f0 watcher repair. Pulled xy twice and kept that published watcher and control whole, withdrawing the duplicate comment and mode changes from this recovery.
obs Preserved the recovered dated log unchanged. Its file fields describe its own parked work; this log records the later withdrawal of the duplicate watcher edit.
obs The recovered baton-rule references clear seed_link: 848 other living links against ceiling 848, zero front-door links outside the seed. Public publishing remains gated.
obs Both session rosters now agree with all 48 shelf indexes; September 8 reads 162 in both. One absorbed overflow shelf remains named in only one table, at its existing ceiling of one.
obs Shortened only the unpublished recovery summary in ITINERARY to fit beside Diffuser's account. The full parked wording remains in the stash.
